{"seq":48,"slug":"potential-theory","title":"位势论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"位势论-从引力场到调和世界的统一语言\">位势论：从引力场到调和世界的统一语言</h1><p>十八世纪的天文学家想知道一团质量在远处产生的引力，物理学家想知道一块带电导体表面如何分布电荷，二十世纪的概率学家想知道一个随机游走的粒子最终会撞到哪片边界——这些看似无关的问题，最后都归结到同一个方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta u = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 和它的解。位势论就是研究这个方程、它的解（调和函数）以及由质量或电荷生成的&quot;位势&quot;的数学分支。它把静电学、引力、稳态热传导、不可压流体、复分析和布朗运动缝合进一张网，用同一套工具解释它们共同的结构。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿四条主线递进，每条主线是前一条的自然延伸。第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：什么是调和函数，它凭什么如此特殊——均值性质、极值原理、Harnack 不等式、瞬间光滑到解析。第二条是<strong>边值问题</strong>：既然内部由方程约束，那么给定边界数据能否唯一地重建内部？这就是 Dirichlet 问题，配套的工具是 Green 函数与 Poisson 核，它们把&quot;解方程&quot;变成&quot;对边界数据积分&quot;。第三条是<strong>容量</strong>：当我们研究质量真正生成的位势（牛顿位势、Riesz 位势）时，会遇到一个比测度、比 Lebesgue 零集更精细的&quot;大小&quot;概念——容量，以及使能量最小的平衡测度。第四条是<strong>应用与联系</strong>：布朗运动给了整套理论一个概率解释（调和 = 鞅、容量 = 击中概率），而静电学、引力、边界元数值方法、图 Laplacian 上的半监督学习则是它在物理与工程中的落地。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：<strong>数学专业读者</strong>按 1→2→3→4 顺序通读，容量一章需要一点测度论基础；<strong>物理/工程背景读者</strong>可先读 <a href=\"foundations/why-potential-theory\">为何位势论</a> 与 <a href=\"practice/physics-applications\">物理应用</a> 建立直觉，再回到基础与边值；<strong>概率方向读者</strong>读完基础后可直接跳到 <a href=\"practice/brownian-connection\">布朗运动的概率联系</a>，再按需回补容量。前置知识：多元微积分（梯度、散度、Laplace 算子、格林公式）、基本的常微分/偏微分方程概念，容量与平衡测度一章还需要一点实分析与测度论。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界要说清楚。位势论只讲 Laplace/Poisson 方程这一族&quot;椭圆稳态&quot;问题的<strong>深层结构</strong>——为什么解如此规整、如何用位势与容量刻画它；至于偏微分方程的一般分类、特征线、双曲/抛物方程、数值差分格式，属于 <a href=\"../differential-equations/\">微分方程</a> hub。调和函数与全纯函数的实部/虚部关系、共形映射、留数——那是 <a href=\"../complex-analysis/\">复分析</a> hub 的主场，本 hub 只在需要时借用。布朗运动本身的构造、鞅、Itô 积分属于 <a href=\"../stochastic-processes/\">随机过程</a> hub，本 hub 只讲它与调和函数的对偶。Lebesgue 测度与积分的严格构造在 <a href=\"../real-analysis-measure/\">实分析与测度</a> hub，本 hub 直接使用。理解这些边界，你才能把位势论放在整张数学地图上，而不是当成一堆孤立技巧。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：调和函数为什么是数学中最\"规矩\"的函数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-potential-theory","title":"为何位势论：一个方程如何统一引力、电场与随机世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/foundations/why-potential-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"harmonic-functions","title":"调和函数：满足 Laplace 方程的\"最光滑\"函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/foundations/harmonic-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mean-value-maximum","title":"均值性质与极值原理：位势论的两块基石","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/foundations/mean-value-maximum"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"boundary","title":"边值：给定边界，能否唯一重建内部","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/boundary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dirichlet-problem","title":"Dirichlet 问题：给定边界值，找回内部的调和函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/boundary/dirichlet-problem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"green-functions","title":"Green 函数：把区域的几何压进一个核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/boundary/green-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"poisson-kernel","title":"Poisson 核与表示：在球上把解写成一个积分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/boundary/poisson-kernel"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"capacity","title":"容量：一种比测度更精细的\"大小\"","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"newtonian-potential","title":"牛顿位势：由质量生成的场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/newtonian-potential"},{"seq":2,"slug":"capacity","title":"容量与细集：比测度更锐利的\"可忽略\"标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/capacity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"equilibrium-measure","title":"平衡测度：电荷如何自己找到最省力的分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/capacity/equilibrium-measure"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用：当调和世界遇上随机游走、电磁场与算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"brownian-connection","title":"布朗运动的概率联系：调和函数的随机化身","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice/brownian-connection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"physics-applications","title":"物理应用：静电、引力与稳态世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice/physics-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"potential-theory-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：从边界元法到图上的调和函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice/potential-theory-in-practice"}]}]}